  "content": "\n\n<h1><span style=\"color:#1f1f1f\"><strong>Cobblemon：新增内容</strong></span></h1>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#1f1f1f\">◽ 本项目旨在基于Cobblemon模组添加各类物品、盔甲、矿石、工具与武器。</span></strong><br><strong><span style=\"color:#1f1f1f\">若您希望搭配MOD CREATE的配方游玩此版本，请访问我的另一款模组：</span></strong> <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong><a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-cobblemon-industries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobblemon: Create Industries</a></strong></span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#1f1f1f\"><strong>当前功能：</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"color:#1f1f1f\"><strong><span style=\"color:#1f1f1f\">◽ </span>盔甲<br>- 新增8套优于钻石套装的盔甲，附带附魔及永久药水效果。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#1f1f1f\"><strong>◽ 工具与武器。<br>- 新增40种工具与武器，合成时自带附魔。</strong></span></p>\n<hr>\n<h1>盔甲属性</h1>\n<table style=\"width:100%\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\"><strong>盔甲类型</strong></th>\n<th style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\"><strong>特殊效果</strong></th>\n<th style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\"><strong>靴子附魔</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\">火之石</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\">抗火</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\">火焰保护 II</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\">水之石</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\">水下呼吸</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\">水下速掘 II</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\">叶之石</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\">无</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\">摔落缓冲 III + 荆棘 III</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\">雷之石</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\">急迫 II + 移速提升 50%</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\">无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\">日之石</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\">无</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\">保护 IV + 弹射物保护 IV</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\">月之石</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\">无</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\">保护 IV + 爆炸保护 IV</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\">黎明石</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\">跳跃提升 IV + 摔落伤害免疫</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\">无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\">黄昏石</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\">饱和</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\">无</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<hr>\n<ul>\n<li>- 所有盔甲均需使用对应的进化石制作。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_6a264b91-140c-42d4-bebf-f461fedf6632.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"345\" height=\"215\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_f5348add-f280-4475-80be-e313b4c314fb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"215\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a1ac8df3-d51c-470a-9603-b0f23174a1f8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"437\" height=\"155\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_042b6cd6-ada2-48a3-8b4c-b7ac0781f984.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"824\" height=\"170\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1263211/description_2c42bba3-6a8c-4df3-a10b-4a8102c8ab98.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"130\" height=\"202\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1263211/description_66510804-6e5b-43fe-9b02-0214d9863f95.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"125\" height=\"201\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1263211/description_d088154b-d0ae-45c1-bba0-5c352a910210.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"129\" height=\"202\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1263211/description_02701298-5f6e-4511-a3f4-1a776027c12b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"129\" height=\"200\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1263211/description_5862ee7b-c5d6-4dd7-bdaa-0e267f4d4231.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"116\" height=\"201\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1263211/description_31ed17b0-0cb5-4b01-b258-76a59aaadc9e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"122\" height=\"202\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1263211/description_60f3bb04-6f98-4b40-8276-795cc2ec4509.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"124\" height=\"223\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1263211/description_d7caa27c-a9ea-4004-8d7a-e26c2fd16d7e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"127\" height=\"208\"></p>",
